{"4846640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Force Tilt", "steam_appid": 4846640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force Tilt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the late 21st century, after the downfall of civilisation. Make your way through a derelict facility, free the ones trapped inside and find the source of the undoing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D, First-Person, Physics based, Puzzle Platformer. Set across roughly 20 puzzle levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain abilities to manipulate the forces of physics to solve hazardous puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anti Gravity - Items float to the top of the room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale Manipulation - Change the size and mass of objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electromagnetism - Objects snap to certain surfaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time - Objects traverse backwards through time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in Unreal Engine 5 by</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thomas Bennett</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matthew Viljoen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bradley Hannan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyler Kemp</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force Tilt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the late 21st century, after the downfall of civilisation. Make your way through a derelict facility, free the ones trapped inside and find the source of the undoing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D, First-Person, Physics based, Puzzle Platformer. Set across roughly 20 puzzle levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain abilities to manipulate the forces of physics to solve hazardous puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anti Gravity - Items float to the top of the room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale Manipulation - Change the size and mass of objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electromagnetism - Objects snap to certain surfaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time - Objects traverse backwards through time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in Unreal Engine 5 by</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thomas Bennett</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matthew Viljoen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bradley Hannan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyler Kemp</p>", "short_description": "A 3D, First-Person, Physics based, Puzzle Platformer. ", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4846640/6f1567325c516c518987c00b50fce6a743bc4514/header.jpg?t=1782397652", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4846640/419143c6456f3ffd08671e3b111913fe5a87b30b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782397652", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4846640/419143c6456f3ffd08671e3b111913fe5a87b30b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782397652", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["TMBT"